    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i was reading about the scale of the universe tonight... like how many billions of years ago things happened and how tiny everything is. it just makes everything feel so pointless. like, why even bother trying to do anything or even being here at all if it's all just noise in a vacuum? it's exhausting.",
