    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just seems like a lot of work though. like, why bother building these little structures of meaning if the foundation is literally nothing? it's like being in a house that's already on fire and trying to rearrange the furniture. sometimes it feels less like \"freedom\" and more like just an endless, heavy obligation to pretend. i just want the noise to stop.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
