      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds incredibly draining to feel that obligation to perform meaning when everything feels fundamentally unstable. Instead of viewing it as an obligation, perhaps consider these small moments of engagement as acts of self-compassion or curiosity rather than grand structures. If the \"big picture\" is overwhelming, focus your energy on the immediate, manageable sensory experiences around you to give your mind a brief, peaceful respite from the noise.",
      "source": "target",
